<title>HUNGARY: Graboplast to buy own shares.</title>
<headline>Graboplast to buy own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian home improvement product maker group Graboplast Rt said on Wednesday it plans to buy upto 40,000 of its own shares at market price.</p>
<p>On the Budapest Stock Exchange Graboplast shares finished at 8,690 forints, up 50, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
